    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "As we follow the event's progress, the leading team has already passed the cycling checkpoint, and it's now that we're seeing a change in the contest!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "After the might-and-power LUNG wRATh of Round 1 passed the cycling checkpoint and got to riding, another team's immediately begun to personally deal with them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "And moreover, they seem to have changed strategies this time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lady Candela, can we invite you to explain to everyone, please!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Isn't it clear? This bunch know that even attacking all at once doesn't ensure they're an opponent to the team, so they've elected to stall them out, and not to overpower them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tactics like that put you up very close to those two in the footrace, but plenty of moves get tricky to pull when you're on a vehicle.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "So here in the cycling segment is where they're opting to do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "It goes without saying, the results aren't bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Without a doubt. They've gotten just close enough to LUNG wRATh, without moving up to attack. It's been trick after trick to harass them, giving them no way to comfortably pick up the pace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "We can see just how far behind the leading team LUNG wRATh is!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "They're stuck with a handicap on their bikes, and getting off means falling behind! LUNG wRATh face their biggest crisis in the competition yet!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
