    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_196_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're not trying to defeat us, just stall us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_486_espumo_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the plan? We're hard-pressed to try combat cycling. We'll be completely held up at this rate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ernesto"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hushed) It seems someone wants us to take a shortcut.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hushed) I'm on the same page.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hushed) Go for it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Hushed) Heh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
